<title>UK: Inspirations in talks that may lead to offer.</title>
<headline>Inspirations in talks that may lead to offer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British tour operator Inspirations Plc said on Thursday it has been in talks for some months which may lead to an offer being made for the company.</p>
<p>Its shares were up one pence to 80-1/2 by 1408 GMT.  </p>
<p>The company, responding to the recent increase in its share price, said that any offer was unlikely to be above the current market price.</p>
<p>The share price had hit a high of 91 pence on Wednesday, up from Tuesday's close of 79-1/2 pence.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
</text>
